MintBrew source ancestry
========================

RavensClawX created HBLauncher and its GPU app environment. MintBrew uses the
same app ABI.

NiftyNova maintains GPUBrewLauncher, the fork whose console host/runtime is
the base of MintBrew. MintBrew includes GPUBrewLauncher's Hello World and
Froggy Road app builds.

GPUBrewLauncher's credits additionally name fuyuka / touhoufagyuri and Rosalie
for changes and improvements. The original source snapshots remain in this
repository as vendor/HBLauncher and vendor/GPUBrewLauncher.

mac2jb contributes the MintBrew name, dark/mint menu, curated catalog, and Mac
packaging integration. The published ftpd-sb v0.1.0 app is added separately by
mac2jb's pinned overlay workflow.

